# One 4x H100 PCIe node (ARC HTC htc-g053-055) as a custom graph, from
# nvidia-smi topo -m on htc-g055: GPU2-GPU3 are NV12 (NVLink bridge, 12 links
# x 25 GB/s = 300 GB/s per direction), every other pair is "NODE" (PCIe through
# the host bridges). Endpoints 0-3, device 4 = the PCIe host-bridge complex.
# PCIe edge rate is the measured NCCL ring plateau on this node (all-reduce
# busbw 18.6 GB/s = 17.3 GiB/s per direction, nccl-tests job 8892244).
E 0 4 17.3
E 4 0 17.3
E 1 4 17.3
E 4 1 17.3
E 2 4 17.3
E 4 2 17.3
E 3 4 17.3
E 4 3 17.3
E 2 3 279.4
E 3 2 279.4
